<title>USA: Florsheim closes refinancings, sees gain.</title>
<headline>Florsheim closes refinancings, sees gain.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Florsheim Group Inc said Monday it had completed two refinancing arrangements that are expected to reduce the company's interest expense by about $2 million, which should enhance net earnings by $0.15 a share on an annualized basis.</p>
</text>
